7
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,240
Are all ability levels welcome?

8
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:37,100
Woman: Yes, I'll e-mail you the link to sign up

9
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:40,040
Just be aware that spots are going fast.
